<title>FRANCE: Block of 9.5 percent in UFB Locabail traded.</title>
<headline>Block of 9.5 percent in UFB Locabail traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A block of 550,000 shares in UFB-Locabail, representing 9.5 percent of the capital, was traded at 600 francs on Thursday the last day of the buy-out bid by Compagnie Bancaire, traders said.</p>
</text>
